Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hi! How can I help you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for checking in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the new face of management
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's basically hell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's coffee on my shirt, and burns on my arm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess hot oil really hurts a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Working overtime, cuz someone called out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we're running out of ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me how?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To make everything worse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the lights just went dark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, won't you tell me when it's gonna stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep yelling, I am gonna have a panic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Given the circumstances, I'm doing the very best I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,mario kart ahh sound effect 🥀🙏 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile, baby smile for the corporation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Vital, baby vital to the operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Working for an hour costs as much as a sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be more than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be more than this!
